#. name of box generator
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "GridfinityTrayLayout"
msgstr "Vassoio Gridfinity da schema"

#. description of GridfinityTrayLayout
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "A Gridfinity Tray Generator based on TrayLayout"
msgstr "Generatore di vassoi Gridfinity basato su Vassoio da schema"

#. long description of GridfinityTrayLayout in markdown
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"This is a general purpose gridfinity tray generator.  You can create\n"
"somewhat arbitrarily shaped trays, or just do nothing for simple grid\n"
"shaped trays.\n"
"\n"
"The dimensions are automatically calculated to fit perfectly into a\n"
"gridfinity grid (like the GridfinityBase, or any other Gridfinity\n"
"based base).\n"
"\n"
"Edit the layout text graphics to adjust your tray.\n"
"You can replace the hyphens and vertical bars representing the walls\n"
"with a space character to remove the walls.  You can replace the space\n"
"characters representing the floor by a \"X\" to remove the floor for\n"
"this compartment.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Questo è un generatore di vassoi Gridfinity per uso generale. Puoi creare\n"
"vassoi di forma quasi libera, oppure lasciare lo schema così com'è per\n"
"semplici vassoi a griglia.\n"
"\n"
"Le dimensioni vengono calcolate automaticamente per adattarsi perfettamente "
"a una\n"
"griglia Gridfinity (come la Base Gridfinity o qualsiasi altra base\n"
"compatibile Gridfinity).\n"
"\n"
"Modifica lo schema di testo per adattare il vassoio.\n"
"Puoi sostituire i trattini e le barre verticali che rappresentano le pareti\n"
"con uno spazio per eliminarle. Puoi sostituire gli spazi\n"
"che rappresentano il fondo con una \"X\" per eliminare il fondo di\n"
"quello scomparto.\n"

msgid "GridfinityTrayLayout Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni vassoio Gridfinity da schema"

#. help for parameter h
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "height in mm or add 'u' at the end for Gridfinity units"
msgstr ""
"altezza in mm, oppure aggiungi 'u' alla fine per indicarla in unità "
"Gridfinity"

#. help for parameter hi
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid ""
"inner height of inner walls in mm (leave to zero for same as outer walls "
"with optional reduction for stacking)"
msgstr ""
"altezza delle pareti interne in mm (lascia 0 per usare la stessa delle "
"pareti esterne, con l'eventuale riduzione per l'impilamento)"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "nx"
msgstr "nx"

#. help for parameter nx
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "number of gridfinity grids in X direction"
msgstr "numero di celle Gridfinity in direzione X"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "ny"
msgstr "ny"

#. help for parameter ny
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "number of gridfinity grids in Y direction"
msgstr "numero di celle Gridfinity in direzione Y"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "countx"
msgstr "divisioni x"

#. help for parameter countx
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "split x into this many grid sections.  0 means same as --nx"
msgstr "numero di scomparti in cui dividere x. 0 significa uguale a --nx"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "county"
msgstr "divisioni y"

#. help for parameter county
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "split y into this many grid sections.  0 means same as --ny"
msgstr "numero di scomparti in cui dividere y. 0 significa uguale a --ny"

#. help for parameter margin
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "Leave this much total margin on the outside, in mm"
msgstr "Margine totale da lasciare all'esterno, in mm"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "stacking"
msgstr "impilabile"

#. help for parameter stacking
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "support gridfinity compatible stacking"
msgstr "rende il vassoio impilabile in modo compatibile con Gridfinity"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "gen_pads"
msgstr "genera piedini"

#. help for parameter gen_pads
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "generate pads to be used on the bottom of the box"
msgstr "genera i piedini da applicare sotto il fondo della scatola"

#. parameter name
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "base_thickness"
msgstr "spessore base"

#. help for parameter base_thickness
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid ""
"the thickness of base the box will sit upon.  0 to use the material "
"thickness, 4.65 for a standard Gridfinity 3D printed base"
msgstr ""
"spessore della base su cui poggerà la scatola. 0 per usare lo spessore del "
"materiale, 4.65 per una base Gridfinity standard stampata in 3D"

#. help for parameter layout
#: boxes/generators/gridfinitytraylayout.py
msgid "You can hand edit this before generating"
msgstr "Puoi modificarlo a mano prima di generare"

